[00:00.000] 作词 : Traditional
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Traditional
[00:05.066]God save our gracious King
[00:09.777]Long live our noble King
[00:15.507]God save the King
[00:21.239]Send him victorious
[00:26.977]Happy and glorious
[00:32.802]Long to reign over us
[00:38.720]God save the King
[00:47.057]Thy choicest gifts in store
[00:52.975]On his be pleased to pour
[00:58.320]Long may he reign
[01:04.559]May he defend our laws
[01:10.777]And ever give us cause
[01:16.994]To sing with heart and voice
[01:24.021]God save the King